// Accept twin of reject/E-KIND-KEYWORD-SHAPE/bare-parameterized-ward.ron:
// the SAME keyword used through its macro invocation — `Ward` is declared
// `Costed` ([CR#702.21a] "ward [cost]") and the invocation carries the
// typed cost arg, so the shape check resolves.
Normal(
  name: "Accept Invoked Ward",
  types: [Creature],
  abilities: [
    Keyword(Ward([Mana([Generic(2)])])),
  ],
  power: 1,
  toughness: 1,
)
